	<brief_description>
		A builder for systems.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		This example shows the creation of a system that runs over entities with the [i]Run[/i] and [i]Jump[/i] components:
		[codeblock]
		GFSystemBuilder.new() \
		    .with("Run") \
		    .with("Jump") \
		    .for_each(func(run:GFComponent, jump:GFComponent):
		        pass
		        )
		[/codeblock]
	</description>
	<tutorials>
		<link title="More on Flecs Systems">https://www.flecs.dev/flecs/md_docs_2Systems</link>
	</tutorials>
